# =============================================================================
# poly_bot — environment template
# =============================================================================
#
# This project currently needs NO environment variables and NO .env file.
# Every script (btc_5m_paper_trader.py, btc_5m_*_scrape.py, btc_5m_ws_recorder.py)
# only reads Polymarket's public Gamma/CLOB/Data REST APIs and the public
# CLOB market WebSocket feed — no API key, wallet, or secret of any kind is
# required to run anything in this repo.
#
# This file is kept only as a placeholder for future configuration (e.g. if
# live order execution is ever added) and is intentionally empty of settings
# today. See README.md "Running it" for the actual setup steps.
